            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobonokis Yosua ebe, “Naarai aponi kolimokinai eut ikonikejaanakinak kwape ecorakinitor EJAKAIT Ekonideke ekekejaanakinan Musa ainakin yes akwap kere, ka amudiar kere luibojete kakwap kakonyenekus; kanuka nun kipou kakuriakata noi kanuka aijarakosi kanukus, ŋes kiswamaa akirot nin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.16.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Age 16:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso koany, kijaa akanikon: kiswamakinai sio nuitojokit ijo nuedolit jo aiswamakin sio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswamak ŋesi kes kwaŋin, kolaku kes kakan naka idwe luka Isirael, mam apotu koara kes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.26"
            ]
